{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 ReaRoll\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 ReaRoll is a compact piano roll for sketching MIDI ideas in REAPER. This is a testing release by Davvo.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Requirements\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab REAPER\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab ReaPack\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab ReaImGui 0.10 or newer\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Install\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 1.\tx360\tab In REAPER, choose {\b Extensions > ReaPack > Import repositories}.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 2.\tx360\tab Import {\f1 https://raw.githubusercontent.com/davvolinni-ui/ReaRoll/main/index.xml}.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 3.\tx360\tab Synchronize packages, then install {\b ReaRoll}.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 4.\tx360\tab Run {\b ReaRoll - compact sketching piano roll} from the Action List.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The package also installs {\b ReaRoll - Reset Window} for recovering a hidden or off-screen window. ReaRoll remains a testing release until it is proven stable. Updates are delivered through ReaPack synchronization.\par}
